      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "text": "开通坎那贝拉村路线：",
      "type": "route-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        36
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 37,
      "text": "1.由阿凯鲁法村南门，通过南恰拉山第一通道、南恰拉山第二通道前往米内葛尔岛（309.349）处与阿德基姆对话，",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        37
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "text": "持有【大地的结晶】可整个队直接通过；如果没有则要和他战斗（两连战），战胜后方可通过。",
      "type": "route-condition",
      "sourceLines": [
        38
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "text": "◆生产系（包含护士医生）：可直接与南边的「渡船商黑狗」（310.357）交谈，花费200G单人直接传送到对面，不需【大地的结晶】",
      "type": "career-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        39
